OL,3,ACan scent help make your rental feel
OL,4,Alike home?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt can be a balancing act making a
OL,7,Frented property feel like your own.
OL,9,FYou want somewhere that feels warm and
OL,10,Fpersonal but without spending a fortune
OL,11,Fchanging a flat or house owned by
OL,12,Fsomeone else and making alterations
OL,13,Fthat put a deposit at risk.
OL,15,FHigher average mortgage rates and hefty
OL,16,Fdeposits mean buying a home is out of
OL,17,Freach for many, who are renting for
OL,18,Flonger.
OL,20,FThe good news is that transforming a
OL,21,Frental doesn't have to mean a major
OL,22,Frenovation.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
